{"title":"1963 AHSME Problems/Problem 19","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1963_AHSME_Problems/Problem_19&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>In counting <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/7/4/174fadd07fd54c9afe288e96558c92e0c1da733a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"13\" height=\"10\" /> colored balls, some red and some black, it was found that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/4/c/34c8e6bf4d57cd6f2bb0d7d43e00f0f442f53b84.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$49$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"17\" height=\"13\" /> of the first <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/0/6/906734e2f1010e9a171ffee8050cbc0649cea37c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$50$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" /> counted were red. \nThereafter, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/0/a/e0a0db32027a732ac57d37ef2ae9bb150f65b108.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$7$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> out of every <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/4/5/8455f3b5cb3b4880b8c9d782a5c1f0334db819eb.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$8$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> counted were red. If, in all, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/f/c/bfcfee7bd8a5e15e5f6b7881c138de43651572a9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$90$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" />&#160;% or more of the balls counted were red, the maximum value of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/7/4/174fadd07fd54c9afe288e96558c92e0c1da733a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"13\" height=\"10\" /> is:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/c/4/fc446b872e64759cbb91f315c9dc0a455ffce0b0.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(A)}\\ 225 \\qquad \\textbf{(B)}\\ 210 \\qquad \\textbf{(C)}\\ 200 \\qquad \\textbf{(D)}\\ 180 \\qquad \\textbf{(E)}\\ 175$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"439\" height=\"17\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1963_AHSME_Problems/Problem_19&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>The desired percentage of red balls is more than <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/f/c/bfcfee7bd8a5e15e5f6b7881c138de43651572a9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$90$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" /> percent, so write an <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Inequality\" title=\"Inequality\">inequality</a>.\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/2/7/027ba26b5e70758d2686e6d7ba39e3e9ae5dc87a.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\frac{49+7x}{50+8x} \\ge 0.9\\]\" width=\"108\" height=\"39\" />\n</p><p>Since <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/8/9/2897ed386db607e2c2eaa8c12de08389e54dd872.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x &gt;0$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"43\" height=\"13\" />, the sign does not need to be swapped after multiplying both sides by <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/c/3/7c3b242e5e389345ce0129677d1a54822bb55943.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$50+8x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"59\" height=\"14\" />.\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/2/b/72b030a39d93386a375b121a6f2b304ff579f493.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[49+7x \\ge 45+7.2x\\]\" width=\"157\" height=\"15\" />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/f/7/0f7a99e0dfc0e3648d4f5dbb9339ebbc9567d22f.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[4 \\ge 0.2x\\]\" width=\"66\" height=\"15\" />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/1/1/c11bd623c889aa07479422eb958a76257335616e.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[20 \\ge x\\]\" width=\"52\" height=\"15\" />\n</p><p>Thus, up to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/8/3/f8366cd6196dd8a9da6d38a3e9eafb109e99d53e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$20$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" /> batches of balls can be used, so a total of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/b/5/db58ae934b902be85817544ed610f851357e5eae.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$20 \\cdot 8 + 50 = 210$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"131\" height=\"14\" /> balls can be counted while satisfying the requirements.  The answer is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/2/1/a2194b81820e8380be586c1564c3f5d03d5c100d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{\\textbf{(B)}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"42\" height=\"30\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1963_AHSME_Problems/Problem_19&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1963_AHSME\" title=\"1963 AHSME\">1963 AHSC</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1963_AHSME_Problems\" title=\"1963 AHSME Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1963_AHSME_Answer_Key\" title=\"1963 AHSME Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/resources.php?c=182&amp;cid=44&amp;year=1963\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1963_AHSME_Problems/Problem_18\" title=\"1963 AHSME Problems/Problem 18\">Problem 18</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1963_AHSME_Problems/Problem_20\" title=\"1963 AHSME Problems/Problem 20\">Problem 20</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1963_AHSME_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"1963 AHSME Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1963_AHSME_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"1963 AHSME Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1963_AHSME_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"1963 AHSME Problems/Problem 3\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1963_AHSME_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"1963 AHSME Problems/Problem 4\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1963_AHSME_Problems/Problem_5\" title=\"1963 AHSME Problems/Problem 5\">5</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1963_AHSME_Problems/Problem_6\" title=\"1963 AHSME Problems/Problem 6\">6</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1963_AHSME_Problems/Problem_7\" title=\"1963 AHSME Problems/Problem 7\">7</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1963_AHSME_Problems/Problem_8\" title=\"1963 AHSME Problems/Problem 8\">8</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1963_AHSME_Problems/Problem_9\" title=\"1963 AHSME Problems/Problem 9\">9</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1963_AHSME_Problems/Problem_10\" title=\"1963 AHSME Problems/Problem 10\">10</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1963_AHSME_Problems/Problem_11\" title=\"1963 AHSME Problems/Problem 11\">11</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1963_AHSME_Problems/Problem_12\" title=\"1963 AHSME Problems/Problem 12\">12</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1963_AHSME_Problems/Problem_13\" title=\"1963 AHSME Problems/Problem 13\">13</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?t